# Generated / patient data — kept out of the public repo.
# This repo is PUBLIC, so the patterns are deliberately wider than the exact
# build paths: a backup like `public/data.bak/` is not matched by `public/data/`
# and would otherwise be committed.
public/data/
public/data*
profile_source/
profile_source*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
